# AlfaClub ops (path-scoped)

- **`ALFACLUB_API_KEY` only** — no shadow bot tokens (`WENAKITA_*`, duplicate bot keys).
- Command replies: **Privy JWT WebSocket lane**; ingress via authenticated API (do not delete API path).
- **`/h` is the sole public Hermit entrypoint** — no legacy `/arena` flat remaps.
- Room 1659 inverse: FriendKey stake gate; no bot-self-trade; harvest-and-dip on add/reduce.
- Product shell: **`alfaclub.4626.fun`**; chat API proxy stays on `relay.4626.fun`.
- **ETH→FriendKey buy:** composite only — ETH → Zora AKITA → Sudoswap ERC-1155. Full native sentinel `0xeee…eee` (40 hex); funding preview must not require SIWE; do not treat ETH/key as a direct rate. Detail: `docs/agent-context/archives/alfaclub-ops-core.md` § ETH → FriendKey.

